{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355930/extras/description1.png?t=1739614775\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the distant future, prosthetic bodies have become commonplace. Merrick is a <i>purist</i> living in such era.\u00a0He rejects the powerful mechanical body in favor of his fragile biological body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why does Merrick put himself through such pain? Wouldn't we all be free from disease, aging, and loss if we could just shed our flesh and adopt a body of metal?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mechanical Throb is a story-driven puzzle adventure game.\u00a0Explore a\u00a0glamourous futuristic world and uncover the secrets of its biggest medical engineering company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various puzzles that blend with the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cute  characters drawn in the chibi art style</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Charming 2D pixel art</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story-driven game without any complex controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bunnies</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3355930?t=1739614775","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3355930?t=1739614775","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355930/b7b2944adc7aea41846a0cd1e3a7152458f25b46/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739614775","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355930/b7b2944adc7aea41846a0cd1e3a7152458f25b46/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739614775","categories":[{"description":"Single-player",